a number called ig is 'run shell' of "rm -rf ./vf_loop_findings" and 5000.

'fuzz gen run' of 1 and 5 and 8 and 10000.
Print "total: {stat_total}".
Print "compiled at least 4 of 5: {stat_compiled is greater than 3}".
a number called ig2 is 'run shell' of "rm -rf ./vf_loop_findings" and 5000.